---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Location sono, lumière et vidéo mapping à Amiens | Event'Light"
description: "Event'Light : location et installation sono, lumière, effets et structures à Amiens. Mariages, anniversaires, CE, sport. Spécialiste du vidéo mapping dans la Somme."
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-field" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="play-wrap">
    <div class="ring"></div>
    <div class="ring r2"></div>
    <button type="button" class="play-btn" id="hero-play" aria-label="Composer la lumière">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4 3L20 12L4 21Z"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
  <h1 class="rgb-heading">
    <span class="layer base">Composez la lumière</span>
    <span class="layer r" aria-hidden="true">Composez la lumière</span>
    <span class="layer g" aria-hidden="true">Composez la lumière</span>
    <span class="layer b" aria-hidden="true">Composez la lumière</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="lead">Mariage, anniversaire, comité d'entreprise, manifestation sportive : Event'Light crée votre événement à Amiens comme un signal — son, lumière, effets et <strong>vidéo mapping</strong>.</p>
  <div class="hero-tracks">
    <span><i style="background:var(--cyan)"></i>Lumière</span>
    <span><i style="background:var(--red)"></i>Mapping</span>
    <span><i style="background:var(--yellow)"></i>Effets</span>
    <span><i style="background:var(--blue)"></i>Son</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn solid" href="/devis/">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4 3L20 12L4 21Z"/></svg>
      Composer mon devis
    </a>
    <a class="btn ghost-dark" href="/portfolio/">Voir le portfolio</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-damier" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<div class="op-band" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="section" id="composer">
    <h2 class="section-title">Composez votre projet</h2>
    <p class="section-note">L'écran reste noir, comme un moniteur de régie. Activez les pistes : le rendu se construit sous vos yeux — damier, faisceaux, mapping.</p>
    <div class="builder">
      <div class="preview" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="layer2 on" data-layer="lumiere"></div>
        <div class="layer2 on" data-layer="mapping"></div>
        <div class="layer2" data-layer="son"></div>
        <div class="layer2" data-layer="effets"></div>
        <span class="monitor-badge mono">PGM</span>
        <span class="readout mono">RENDU EN DIRECT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tracks">
        <div class="track-row on">
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" checked onchange="toggleTrack('lumiere', this.checked, this)">
            <span class="switch"></span>
          </label>
          <span class="track-name">Lumière</span>
          <span class="track-swatch" style="background:var(--cyan)"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="track-row on">
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" checked onchange="toggleTrack('mapping', this.checked, this)">
            <span class="switch"></span>
          </label>
          <span class="track-name">Mapping vidéo</span>
          <span class="track-swatch" style="background:var(--red)"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="track-row">
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleTrack('son', this.checked, this)">
            <span class="switch"></span>
          </label>
          <span class="track-name">Son</span>
          <span class="track-swatch" style="background:var(--yellow)"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="track-row">
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleTrack('effets', this.checked, this)">
            <span class="switch"></span>
          </label>
          <span class="track-name">Effets spéciaux</span>
          <span class="track-swatch" style="background:var(--magenta)"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Nos formules</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Quatre lectures d'un même plateau. Choisissez le type d'événement, on dimensionne le matériel à Amiens.</p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {% for f in formules.pages %}
      <li>
        <a class="card-link" href="/nos-formules/{{ f.slug }}/">
          <div class="frame {{ f.slug | frameClass }}" data-duration="{{ 120 + loop.index0 * 20 }}">
            <span class="badge mono">CH. {% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <div class="controls"><span class="time mono">0:00</span><div class="bar"><div class="playhead"></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cap">{{ f.titre }}<span class="date">À partir de {{ f.packs[0].prix }}</span></div>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Location de matériel</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Projecteurs robotisés, sonorisation, machines à effets, structures. {{ site.livraison }}.</p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {% for c in categories %}
      {% set first = produits | firstOfCat(c.nom) %}
      {% set thumb = first.slug | cover("location") if first else "" %}
      <li>
        <a class="card-link" href="/location/{{ c.slug }}/">
          <div class="frame {{ loop.index0 | folioFrame }}{% if thumb %} has-photo{% endif %}" data-duration="{{ 90 + loop.index0 * 15 }}">
            {% if thumb %}<img src="{{ thumb }}" alt="{{ c.nom }} — location Event'Light Amiens" width="640" height="400" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
            <span class="badge mono">CAT</span>
            <div class="controls"><span class="time mono">0:00</span><div class="bar"><div class="playhead"></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cap">{{ c.nom }}<span class="date">{{ c.h1 }}</span></div>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn" href="/location/">Ouvrir le catalogue</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Portfolio</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Mappings, mariages, galas — extraits de régie. Survolez pour parcourir l'image.</p>
    <div class="polaroids">
      {% for projet in portfolio %}
      {% if loop.index <= 6 %}
      {% set cover = projet.slug | cover("portfolio") %}
      <a class="clip" href="/portfolio/{{ projet.slug }}/">
        <div class="frame {{ loop.index0 | folioFrame }}{% if cover %} has-photo{% endif %}" data-duration="{{ 100 + loop.index0 * 30 }}">
          {% if cover %}
          <img src="{{ cover }}" alt="{{ projet.titre }} — {{ projet.annee }}, Event'Light" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy">
          {% endif %}
          <span class="badge mono">{{ projet.type }}</span>
          <div class="controls"><span class="time mono">0:00</span><div class="bar"><div class="playhead"></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap">{{ projet.titre }}<span class="date">{{ projet.annee }}</span></div>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn" href="/portfolio/">Toute la bande</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Questions fréquentes</h2>
    <dl class="faq">
      {% for item in faq %}
      <div>
        <dt>{{ item.q }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ item.a }}</dd>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </dl>
  </section>
</div>
